WEBVTT

17:33.287 --> 17:34.997
17 years ago

17:35.122 --> 17:37.541
you rode off with Robert Baratheon.

17:39.918 --> 17:43.088
You came back a year later
with another woman's son.

17:44.757 --> 17:47.301
And now you're leaving again.

17:50.054 --> 17:51.764
I have no choice.

17:51.889 --> 17:55.768
That's what men always say
when honor calls.

17:55.893 --> 17:59.229
That's what you tell your families,
tell yourselves.
